      "sentiment": "dislike",
      "content": "I tried it when the Enhanced version came out. This is an extremely mediocre experience. I won't get into details here since now reads these, but in short: it's a very mid game, with basic animations, terrible balance and an incredibly unlikeable main character and a really cool side character that just gets berated by the main one. Combat is ok at best, story is boring and everything you play you will forget 1h max after playing. Don't bother."
